  "releaseNotes": "2.1.1: fixes selector validation and index isolation, form-state matching, meta charset detection, SVG/MathML raw-text handling, DOM root tracking when moving nodes, and ToPlainText() on preformatted or skipped elements. See https://github.com/Nkkinsoft/NkkinParser/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#211.",
